      },
      "text": "### Alkyd (Oil-Based)"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md#014",
      "path": [
        "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:coatings:02-paint-composition, git-history:coatings:02-paint-composition]",
        "canonical_path": "coatings/02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md",
        "concepts": "[paint, composition]",
        "current_path": "coatings/02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md",
        "id": "maxim:coatings:paint-composition",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "coatings",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[paint, composition]",
        "section": "coatings",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Paint Composition",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  CHEMISTRY:\n    Polyester backbone + unsaturated fatty acids from drying oils\n    \"Alkyd\" from \"alcohol\" + \"acid\" (polyol + dibasic acid + fatty acid)\n    Linseed oil, soybean oil, tung oil, safflower oil\n    Oil content: \"long oil\" (>60% oil) = more flexible, slower dry\n                 \"medium oil\" (40-60%) = balanced\n                 \"short oil\" (<40%) = faster dry, harder film"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md#015",
      "path": [
        "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:coatings:02-paint-composition, git-history:coatings:02-paint-composition]",
        "canonical_path": "coatings/02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md",
        "concepts": "[paint, composition]",
        "current_path": "coatings/02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md",
        "id": "maxim:coatings:paint-composition",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "coatings",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[paint, composition]",
        "section": "coatings",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Paint Composition",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "OXIDATIVE CURE:\n    Cures by oxygen absorption and crosslinking (hours to days)\n    NOT by solvent evaporation (solvent just enables application)\n    Continues crosslinking for months — film gets harder over time\n    Oil-soaked rags: exothermic oxidation can cause spontaneous combustion\n    → spread flat to dry or store in sealed metal container with water"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md#016",
      "path": [
        "02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:coatings:02-paint-composition, git-history:coatings:02-paint-composition]",
        "canonical_path": "coatings/02-PAINT-COMPOSITION.md",
