        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Paint Composition",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHERE ALKYD STILL WINS:\n    Priming very old or chalky surfaces\n    Painting in cold (below 50°F) when latex fails\n    Kitchen cabinet finishes (traditional oil-based durability)\n```"
    },
