      "text": "PROPERTIES:\n    Chemical resistance: excellent (acids, bases, solvents)\n    Hardness: very high\n    Adhesion: excellent to metal, concrete\n    UV stability: POOR — epoxy chalks rapidly outdoors\n                  Top with polyurethane or aliphatic urethane\n                  if UV exposure expected"
