      "text": "```\n  WHY TiO₂ IS THE HIDING PIGMENT:\n    Refractive index: rutile TiO₂ = 2.73 (vs glass = 1.5)\n    High RI causes strong light scattering at particle surfaces\n    Light scattering = \"hiding\" the substrate"
    },
