      "text": "PARTICLE SIZE OPTIMIZATION:\n    Maximum scattering at ~200-300 nm particle diameter\n    (λ/2 rule — Mie scattering theory)\n    Paint manufacturers optimize PSD (particle size distribution)\n    for maximum hiding power per pound of TiO₂"
